    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This game only supports <u>local</u> multiplayer</h2><br>Chompies! is a cute couch sports game where you fight for the ball to reach the top of the level and score a goal. Battle it out against your friends or find random Chompies from around the world!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061540/extras/33f9133988e8ade30a4e782fd0cc59de.poster.avif?t=1661231619\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061540/extras/33f9133988e8ade30a4e782fd0cc59de.webm?t=1661231619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061540/extras/33f9133988e8ade30a4e782fd0cc59de.mp4?t=1661231619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Some levels get harder to win when you play solo and aggressive, sometimes you need teamwork and betray one of the Chompies to WIN! but there is always only one winner.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061540/extras/77ae1ab2d874ff96df2a48f6215bc25c.poster.avif?t=1661231619\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061540/extras/77ae1ab2d874ff96df2a48f6215bc25c.webm?t=1661231619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061540/extras/77ae1ab2d874ff96df2a48f6215bc25c.mp4?t=1661231619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2 to 4 PLAYERS in Local Multiplayer</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Juicy Chompies</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 4 unique different environments</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Over 20+ levels</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Lots of cool obstacles</li></ul>",
